CORE
related-init.sv
--aiger
^aag [0-9]+ 2 4 0 [0-9]+ 2 1$
^b0 Verilog::\$root.main.first_only$
^b1 Verilog::\$root.main.every_frame$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
The fourth latch activates the initial-state constraint only in frame zero.
The two original latches initialized from seed remain free in their resets.
